Type: Package
Package: mizerEcopath
Title: Building a Mizer version of an Ecopath model
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Gustav", "Delius", , "gustav.delius@york.ac.uk", role = c("cre", "aut", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4092-8228"))
Maintainer: Gustav Delius <gustav.delius@york.ac.uk>
Description: An interactive Shiny gadget for tuning a mizer model built with
    mizerFromEcopath, together with a growth-diffusion and age-at-size module
    and an allometric alternative to the von Bertalanffy starting model.
